message: "If you use this repository, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Spatially Offset Curvature–Migration Coupling in the Tidal Rupsha–Pasur River Corridor from Multi-Decadal Satellite Observations"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Iftikhar
    given-names: Afif
version: 0.2.0
keywords:
  - "river morphodynamics"
  - "remote sensing"
  - "Landsat"
  - "channel migration"
  - "channel curvature"
  - "Bayesian modeling"
  - "spatial offsets"
  - "tidal rivers"
  - "Bangladesh"
abstract: >
  Reproducible manuscript-supporting analysis of curvature–migration coupling along the tidal Rupsha–Pasur river corridor in southwest Bangladesh using 35 analysis years spanning 1988–2025, satellite-derived channel geometry, width-normalized upstream spatial offsets, uncertainty assessment, and hierarchical Bayesian inference.
